# Tests

- Local: `tests/OxyKit.Render.Api.Tests` (xUnit + `WebApplicationFactory<Program>`).
- Client: `tests/OxyKit.Render.Client.Tests`.
- Mirror product folders: `Inputs/`, `Outputs/`, `Endpoints/`.
- Local API tests: send `X-OxyKit-Render-Key`; assert `/health` and `/v1/health` stay anonymous.
- Internals are visible to the test assembly - test `internal` helpers directly when that is cheaper than HTTP.
- Run:
 - `dotnet test tests/OxyKit.Render.Api.Tests/OxyKit.Render.Api.Tests.csproj`
 - `dotnet test tests/OxyKit.Render.Client.Tests/OxyKit.Render.Client.Tests.csproj`
- Manual/collection smoke lives in `hoppscotch/`; do not embed the collection JSON in the agent context.
